WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.080
Welcome to Matchday Body: Train, Recover, Repeat. I’m

00:00:04.240 --> 00:00:07.440
Brian Kennedy Jr. Your goal is a participation

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:10.400
and preparedness plan. Write your actual training and

00:00:10.480 --> 00:00:13.360
competition schedule and one question for the appropriate

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:16.480
coach or qualified professional. Keep your work private,

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.800
record what you tried, and set a review

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:23.440
date. General education only; no individualized exercise prescription,

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:26.160
injury diagnosis or return-to-play clearance.
